    "notes": "<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>Kim Pham</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Occupation:</strong> Diving Specialist / Medic<br><strong>Age:</strong> 28<br><strong>Personality:</strong> Curious</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong><br><br>ATTRIBUTES</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>STRENGTH:</strong> 3<br><strong>WITS:</strong> 4<br><strong>EMPATHY:</strong> 5<br><strong>AGILITY:</strong> 2</p>\n<p><strong>HEALTH:</strong> 3</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong><br><br>SKILLS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Observation:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Comtech:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Medical Aid:</strong> 4</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong><br><br>TALENTS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Field Surgeon</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Buddy:</strong> Dubov<br><strong>Rival:</strong> Alvarez</p>\n<p><strong>Signature Item:</strong> Old Family Photo</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong><br><br>EQUIPMENT</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Personal Med Kit</strong></li>\n<li><strong>AMVIL'S HEART! &nbsp;(Naproleve -UPP) (2 doses)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><strong><br><br>Backstory</strong></h3>\n<p>Dr. Kim Pham grew up in a farming cooperative far from the ocean, dreaming of exploring alien worlds and charting new frontiers. A trailblazer in her family, she became the first to receive formal education, choosing a career in medicine.</p>\n<p>Driven by her passion for discovery, she seized the opportunity to work on an underwater station on a distant alien planet, acing every underwater skills test with perfect scores.</p>\n<p>However, shortly after her arrival at <strong>Matvey Station</strong>, Pham learned that her family had perished in a devastating&mdash;yet preventable&mdash;farming accident. This tragedy shattered her trust in the UPP&rsquo;s promises to care for its citizens, leaving her disillusioned and burdened with regret over her decision to join.</p>\n<p>Despite her internal conflict, Pham remains a skilled and compassionate medic, committed to helping those in her care.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "adhocitems": ""
  },
