            "label": "Number"
          },
          "comment": {
            "value": "<p><strong>DEKOMPRESS Syringes<br><br></strong></p>\n<p>DEKOMPRESS syringes can be found in all dive preparation areas, medkits, and medbays. The drug prevents the effects of decompression sickness if taken up to an hour before diving and the same before returning to the surface. Failing to do so means death at such deeps.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Since there are no decompression chambers available, these syringes are essential for anyone attempting to leave Novotny without succumbing to this potentially fatal condition.</p>",
